# PSG-only march — pulse arp + wave bass + noise snare (no PCM).
deck 1
bpm 140

track Lead id lead gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type pulse duty 25 env_mode constant vol 13
  gen arp_rate 10 arp_semis 7
  note 60 0 0.25 v 120
  note 60 0.5 0.25 v 110
  note 63 1 0.25 v 120
  note 65 1.5 0.25 v 115
  note 67 2 0.5 v 127
