  note 41 10.5 0.5 v 100
  note 39 11 1 v 110
  note 34 12 0.5 v 120
  note 36 12.5 0.5 v 110
  note 31 13 1 v 115
  note 36 14 1 v 127
  note 36 15 1 v 100

